<title>USA: Illinois Rural Bond Bank yields 5.60 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>Illinois Rural Bond Bank yields 5.60 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it priced $3.765 million of Illinois Rural Bond Bank, revenue bonds, Series 1996 with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2027.</p>
